msgid "and hold"
msgstr "et maintenez"

#. Key:	3FC62CEB4B864BE538DE3790C3B105E4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/SFX/Staging/SW_Cinematic_Introduction.SW_Cinematic_Introduction.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/SFX/Staging/SW_Cinematic_Introduction.SW_Cinematic_Introduction.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",3FC62CEB4B864BE538DE3790C3B105E4"
msgid "Iris: Are you inside?"
msgstr "Iris: Es tu à l'intérieur ?"

#. Key:	C7294027415272FFBAD46085F64E04D3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/SFX/Staging/SW_Cinematic_Introduction.SW_Cinematic_Introduction.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/SFX/Staging/SW_Cinematic_Introduction.SW_Cinematic_Introduction.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",C7294027415272FFBAD46085F64E04D3"
msgid "Charles: Not yet, I'm on my way."
msgstr "Charles: Pas encore, je suis en chemin."

#. Key:	737D06984AA5FA7516D8D2B191FFDCA7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",737D06984AA5FA7516D8D2B191FFDCA7"
msgid "Charles: This is the twelfth operation in three days."
msgstr "Charles : C'est la douzième intervention en trois jours."

#. Key:	0932D8F3451970A4907F28B0499006F3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",0932D8F3451970A4907F28B0499006F3"
msgid "Charles: With so much chaos, we'll soon need a second team."
msgstr "Charles : Avec autant de perturbations, il faudra bientôt une seconde équipe."

#. Key:	7ADA73BC49A9396DB1EBF19FDDDA52FC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",7ADA73BC49A9396DB1EBF19FDDDA52FC"
msgid "Charles: Yesterday I had to miss my daughter's tenth birthday."
msgstr "Charles : Hier, j'ai dû louper le dixième anniversaire de ma fille."

#. Key:	ADD9B28B48E7A935659643AFBE247D62
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",ADD9B28B48E7A935659643AFBE247D62"
msgid "Iris: She didn't hold it against you ?"
msgstr "Iris : Elle ne t'en a pas trop voulu ?"

#. Key:	FB8A5D714F1A1C77C78C1588BF0A3B00
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part1.SW_Script_Family_Part1.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",FB8A5D714F1A1C77C78C1588BF0A3B00"
msgid "Charles: You know, at that age, they tend to move on quickly."
msgstr "Charles : Tu sais, à cet âge là, ça lui passera..."

#. Key:	D1B9E8AE4BD36C74F0DB93B9DFAFC1FA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",D1B9E8AE4BD36C74F0DB93B9DFAFC1FA"
msgid "Charles : My wife, on the other hand, holds it against me."
msgstr "Charles : Ma femme par contre, m'en tient rigueur."

#. Key:	155603A74632E2527C0A1399A2BEDC8E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",155603A74632E2527C0A1399A2BEDC8E"
msgid "Charles: How can you blame her?"
msgstr "Charles: Comment lui en vouloir ?"

#. Key:	421996974E24CF2F9C4A1A9B6F7C698C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",421996974E24CF2F9C4A1A9B6F7C698C"
msgid "Charles: If I do it, it's for their sake first and foremost..."
msgstr "Charles : Si je fais ce travail c’est avant tout pour elles..."

#. Key:	24A392024F9113EC83BD9A86EC18BD94
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Family/SW_Script_Family_Part2.SW_Script_Family_Part2.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",24A392024F9113EC83BD9A86EC18BD94"
msgid "Iris: I'm sure she understands that, family is important."
msgstr "Iris : Je suis sûr qu'elle le comprend."

#. Key:	E61233154F5DDE666BAA348E7A5211E3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_End.SW_Script_FirstRift_End.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_End.SW_Script_FirstRift_End.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",E61233154F5DDE666BAA348E7A5211E3"
msgid "Iris: You can come back to the Cité"
msgstr "Iris: Tu peux revenir à la Cité."

#. Key:	C7889A2548F771E04B4ADC97F91D5511
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_End.SW_Script_FirstRift_End.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_End.SW_Script_FirstRift_End.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",C7889A2548F771E04B4ADC97F91D5511"
msgid "Iris: I start to make my report."
msgstr "Iris: Je commence mon rapport."

#. Key:	73AB1F074D5022AA0D5C6F9ED82CF74C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",73AB1F074D5022AA0D5C6F9ED82CF74C"
msgid "Charles: I've got the distortion in front of me."
msgstr "Charles : J'ai l'interférence en face de moi."

#. Key:	4E569DED498A7C010887E8BF28B4BFD1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",4E569DED498A7C010887E8BF28B4BFD1"
msgid "Iris: Do you have everything you need?"
msgstr "Iris : Tu as tout ce qu'il te faut ?"

#. Key:	D6E839B346A83A1E69FC08A0C9FB9D02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",D6E839B346A83A1E69FC08A0C9FB9D02"
msgid "Charles : Yes, I'm going to set them up all around."
msgstr "Charles : Oui, je vais les installer autour."

#. Key:	DC208B614E565CE5E94F309DF59B7BB4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",DC208B614E565CE5E94F309DF59B7BB4"
msgid "Iris: Take care."
msgstr "Iris : Fais attention à toi."

#. Key:	44220AAC4761BB3D64521B8F55E701BC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.SW_Script_FirstRift_Part1.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",44220AAC4761BB3D64521B8F55E701BC"
msgid "Charles: I'm waiting for them."
msgstr "Charles : Je les attends."

#. Key:	D172F2EF4BC072DCC1433A90358149AE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",D172F2EF4BC072DCC1433A90358149AE"
msgid "Charles: It's all set!"
msgstr "Charles: Tout est en place !"

#. Key:	E4C2458748DAF758F8EC8594684F75ED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.SW_Script_FirstRift_ShootEMP.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",E4C2458748DAF758F8EC8594684F75ED"
msgid "Iris: OK, all you have to do now is activate them with your electric weapon."
msgstr "Iris: Bien, il ne te reste plus qu'à les activer avec ton arme électrique."

#. Key:	891134F642758C7217ED588EF1903B16
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_ShutDownLight.SW_Script_FirstRift_ShutDownLight.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/FirstRift/SW_Script_FirstRift_ShutDownLight.SW_Script_FirstRift_ShutDownLight.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",891134F642758C7217ED588EF1903B16"
msgid "Charles: Fucking fuses!"
msgstr "Charles: Merde ! Les plombs !"

#. Key:	17420853476B748687B4349CC1F8512F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",17420853476B748687B4349CC1F8512F"
msgid "Charles: Erm... didn't you already intervene?"
msgstr "Charles : Euh... vous n'êtes pas déjà intervenus ?"

#. Key:	D36040454F18EF752276658DD6591216
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",D36040454F18EF752276658DD6591216"
msgid "Iris: No, I haven't had time to make my report yet."
msgstr "Iris : Non je n'ai pas encore eu le temps de faire mon rapport."

#. Key:	98D10C154AD711A7E293EB8EAF6E8822
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",98D10C154AD711A7E293EB8EAF6E8822"
msgid "Charles: Well, I think the corpse has gone."
msgstr "Charles : Bin, je crois bien que le corps s'est fait la malle."

#. Key:	3D19374E4C476B6124AFF0BC0177BD3C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",3D19374E4C476B6124AFF0BC0177BD3C"
msgid "Iris: What do you mean by that?"
msgstr "Iris: Qu'est-ce que tu veux dire ?"

#. Key:	4604CBFE4795CF2C3E295D9801C1F5F4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.SW_Script_Hollandais_CorpseGone.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",4604CBFE4795CF2C3E295D9801C1F5F4"
msgid "Charles: He's no longer there."
msgstr "Charles : Il n'est plus là."

#. Key:	77979D5449844B8DF1815A993A4FB70F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",77979D5449844B8DF1815A993A4FB70F"
msgid "Charles: Fuck!"
msgstr "Charles : Bon... le pauvre n'a pas eu le temps de fuir."

#. Key:	7A5569C840940FD1BF9A488E35D808F4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.SW_Script_Hollandais_Meet.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",7A5569C840940FD1BF9A488E35D808F4"
msgid "Charles: I came too late!"
msgstr "Charles : Tu peux envoyer une equipe de nettoyage."

#. Key:	8C919C76417360AFEC347EA1A6CDA5A5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",8C919C76417360AFEC347EA1A6CDA5A5"
msgid "HELP! HELP!"
msgstr "Á L'AIDE ! AIDEZ-MOI !"

#. Key:	C6346A764A466416F04788A4C098CD2C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",C6346A764A466416F04788A4C098CD2C"
msgid "\"Inaudible noises\""
msgstr "\"Bruits inaudible\""

#. Key:	50F1CD3E48505DFFD5406784A0FECE7A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",50F1CD3E48505DFFD5406784A0FECE7A"
msgid "Charles: I thought everyone had evacuated!"
msgstr "Charles : Je croyais que tout le monde avait évacué !"

#. Key:	FB29F0D24785C2DF9AD205A19CD465E8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",FB29F0D24785C2DF9AD205A19CD465E8"
msgid "Iris : Why? Isn't that the case?"
msgstr "Iris : Pourquoi ? Ce n'est pas le cas ?"

#. Key:	DF9848B34FC1ECA02A4B19BFB6D8A1EB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Hollandais/SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.SW_Script_Hollandais_ScreamForHelp.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",DF9848B34FC1ECA02A4B19BFB6D8A1EB"
msgid "Charles: I'M COMING! WHERE ARE YOU?"
msgstr "Charles : J'ARRIVE ! OU ÊTES VOUS ?"

#. Key:	233BE68C4E9FBAEF3E5A89AA5A1A8FBC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",233BE68C4E9FBAEF3E5A89AA5A1A8FBC"
msgid "Charles: Are we sure everyone's been evacuated?"
msgstr "Charles : On est bien sûr que tout le monde a été évacué ?"

#. Key:	C15595CB4D82F6505AC67ABC9FDF8DA4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",C15595CB4D82F6505AC67ABC9FDF8DA4"
msgid "Iris: Until there's proof to the contrary, you're on your own, so head for the upper tunnels."
msgstr "Iris : Jusqu'à preuve du contraire, tu es seul, dirige-toi vers les tunnels supérieurs."

#. Key:	251F2372422EBE407390A19D4F6B598A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.SW_Script_Introduction_Cite.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",251F2372422EBE407390A19D4F6B598A"
msgid "Iris: Head towards \"Porte de Clignancourt\"."
msgstr "Iris : Prends la direction de 'Porte de Clignancourt'."

#. Key:	7BF393A44A288B66E26065B07C568168
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",7BF393A44A288B66E26065B07C568168"
msgid "Charles : Hey? Did I really have to make a diversion? "
msgstr "Charles: Eh ? Est-ce que le détour était vraiment nécessaire ?"

#. Key:	2C54F6DD4C0B1DE89E1A77BC033E54B2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",2C54F6DD4C0B1DE89E1A77BC033E54B2"
msgid "Iris: You know you mustn't be seen."
msgstr "Iris : Tu sais bien que tu ne dois pas être vue."

#. Key:	BBC387C943297A987A3027BE13EF07DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(2).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",BBC387C943297A987A3027BE13EF07DE"
msgid "Charles : I could have done without it..."
msgstr "Charles : J'aurais pu m'en passer..."

#. Key:	540DDF3B4272A0F50033108C77E4309C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(3).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",540DDF3B4272A0F50033108C77E4309C"
msgid "Iris: Perhaps you'd prefer to make your way through the crowd..."
msgstr "Iris : Tu préférerais peut-être te frayer un chemin dans la foule ?"

#. Key:	8D61A524407C01E21CD1C29B7C70448A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(4).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",8D61A524407C01E21CD1C29B7C70448A"
msgid "Charles: Not really, trade unionists were never my thing."
msgstr "Charles : Pas vraiment, les syndicalistes ça n'a jamais été mon truc."

#. Key:	A6372F094A7B7F38578F66B1E45F75A9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(5).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",A6372F094A7B7F38578F66B1E45F75A9"
msgid "Iris: I would have thought so !"
msgstr "Iris : Je m'en serais douté !"

#. Key:	6B5C3C6D48777E70A9999DB93C7C08BB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(6).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",6B5C3C6D48777E70A9999DB93C7C08BB"
msgid "Charles: Let's stick to the mission, if you don't mind."
msgstr "Charles : Ne relançons pas le sujet tu veux ?"

#. Key:	40EF7C28477381B50B91099A14C7724F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.SW_Script_Introduction_Elevator.Subtitles(7).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",40EF7C28477381B50B91099A14C7724F"
msgid "Iris: Well, good !"
msgstr "Iris : Bien bien comme tu voudras !"

#. Key:	4CD4BBEA404C2FBB16F6DDA17040490E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_UpperTunnel_Electrical.SW_Script_UpperTunnel_Electrical.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Introduction/SW_Script_UpperTunnel_Electrical.SW_Script_UpperTunnel_Electrical.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",4CD4BBEA404C2FBB16F6DDA17040490E"
msgid "Charles: It seems that maintenance is lacking."
msgstr "Charles : La maintenance laisse à désirer."

#. Key:	E66B556344C6C6841C9AB49B675E51F5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",E66B556344C6C6841C9AB49B675E51F5"
msgid "Iris: I know we've been doing a lot of missions recently."
msgstr "Iris : Je sais qu'on a accumulé les missions ces derniers temps."

#. Key:	F30EDE7149F3D81DF55797B47AD0653B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.SW_Script_AttemptFlee1.Subtitles(1).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",F30EDE7149F3D81DF55797B47AD0653B"
msgid "Iris: But that's no reason to abort the mission."
msgstr "Iris : Mais ce n'est pas une raison pour abandonner la mission."

#. Key:	B13B39E64D79494D041A259301B37579
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/CircuitBreaker/SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_1.SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/CircuitBreaker/SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_1.SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_1.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",B13B39E64D79494D041A259301B37579"
msgid "Charles : I should be able to restore power with my gun."
msgstr "Charles : Je devais être capable de l'alimenter avec mon fusil."

#. Key:	1706F4E14209F0B28F55ADA9CAD0096F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/CircuitBreaker/SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_2.SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_2.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/CircuitBreaker/SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_2.SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_2.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",1706F4E14209F0B28F55ADA9CAD0096F"
msgid "Charles : He probably needs a little burst of energy."
msgstr "Charles : Il a probablement besoin d'un petit coup de jus."

#. Key:	ED2131ED4EE7D1731BAE1D860FE0C736
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/CircuitBreaker/SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_3.SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_3.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/CircuitBreaker/SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_3.SW_Script_Tutorial_CircuitBreaker_Variant_3.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",ED2131ED4EE7D1731BAE1D860FE0C736"
msgid "Charles : I might have to recharge it with my gun..."
msgstr "Charles : Je devrais peut être le recharger avec mon fusil..."

#. Key:	125041974679E5EE40A92FBD61C0309E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/SW_Script_Tutorial_BreakDoor.SW_Script_Tutorial_BreakDoor.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
#: /Game/Sounds/Audio/Voices/Tutorial/SW_Script_Tutorial_BreakDoor.SW_Script_Tutorial_BreakDoor.Subtitles(0).Subtitles.Text
msgctxt ",125041974679E5EE40A92FBD61C0309E"
msgid "Charles : I'm going to smash the door down!"
msgstr "Charles : Je vais défoncer la porte !"

